# Build context for sandbox/Dockerfile.vmd is the repo ROOT so the vmd crate can
# see its sibling workspace dep at ../../hash. Allowlist only what the image
# needs; everything else (target/, .git, python venvs) stays out.
**
!hash/Cargo.toml
!hash/Cargo.lock
!hash/src/
!hash/src/**
!sandbox/Cargo.toml
!sandbox/Cargo.lock
!sandbox/vmd/
!sandbox/vmd/**
!sandbox/crates/
!sandbox/crates/**
!sandbox/proto/
!sandbox/proto/**
!sandbox/portproxy/
!sandbox/portproxy/**
!sandbox/patches/
!sandbox/patches/**
!sandbox/scripts/build-patched-virtiofsd.sh
**/target/
**/target/**
